> EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF)
> SELECT (SELECT max((SELECT p1.b FROM a6_part p1 WHERE p1.a = p2.a))) FROM a6_part p2
QUERY PLAN:text
Aggregate
  ->  Gather
        Workers Planned: 3
        ->  Parallel Append
              ->  Parallel Seq Scan on a6_part_p1 p2_1
              ->  Parallel Seq Scan on a6_part_p2 p2_2
  SubPlan 2
    ->  Result
  SubPlan 1
    ->  Append
          ->  Seq Scan on a6_part_p1 p1_1
                Filter: (a = p2.a)
          ->  Seq Scan on a6_part_p2 p1_2
                Filter: (a = p2.a)
-- EXPLAIN

