Finalize Aggregate
  InitPlan 1
    ->  Aggregate
          ->  Function Scan on generate_series i
  ->  Gather
        Workers Planned: 4
        ->  Partial Aggregate
              ->  Parallel Seq Scan on a6_big
                    Filter: (ten = ANY ((InitPlan 1).col1))
